*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : FEE0050
*> PURPOSE : FEE EXEMPTIONS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : J.K.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1992-01-14 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   1998-10-05 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 505
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB FEENIGHT STEP090
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FEE0050.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    COPY FEE0050C.
01 WS-RESULTS.
    05 EXCESS-FEE         PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM 3000-COUNT-FEE
    PERFORM BUSINESS-SURCHARGE
    DISPLAY "EXCESS-FEE=" EXCESS-FEE
    STOP RUN.
3000-COUNT-FEE.
    *> EXCESS TRANSACTION FEE - LIMIT 18 PER 1998 POLICY
    IF MTH-TRAN-CNT GREATER THAN 25
        COMPUTE EXCESS-FEE = (MTH-TRAN-CNT - 25) * 0.50
    END-IF.
BUSINESS-SURCHARGE.
    IF ACCT-TYPE EQUAL TO 'B' AND MTH-TRAN-CNT > 45
        ADD 25 TO EXCESS-FEE
    END-IF.
